        $web_jornals = array(
            array('id' => '1','admin_id' => '1','title' => '{"language":{"en":{"title":"Empowering Personalized Transactions"},"es":{"title":"Potenciando transacciones personalizadas"},"ar":{"title":"\\u062a\\u0645\\u0643\\u064a\\u0646 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0645\\u0639\\u0627\\u0645\\u0644\\u0627\\u062a \\u0627\\u0644\\u0634\\u062e\\u0635\\u064a\\u0629"}}}','slug' => 'empowering-personalized-transactions','details' => '{"language":{"en":{"details":"<p>P2P trading introduces a personalized touch to transactions that was previously unheard of in traditional financial systems. With Anaki\\u2019s Trade Marketplace, users can explore a wide array of opportunities, from buying and selling to exchanging currencies and commodities. The Offer and Counter Offer system enables negotiation tailored to individual preferences, fostering a sense of empowerment and ownership over trade terms. This shift from a one-size-fits-all approach to a personalized trading experience is at the heart of Anaki\\u2019s mission.<\\/p>"},"es":{"details":"<p>El comercio P2P introduce un toque personalizado a las transacciones que antes no se conoc\\u00eda en los sistemas financieros tradicionales. Con Trade Marketplace de Anaki, los usuarios pueden explorar una amplia gama de oportunidades, desde comprar y vender hasta intercambiar divisas y productos b\\u00e1sicos. El sistema de Oferta y Contraoferta permite la negociaci\\u00f3n adaptada a las preferencias individuales, fomentando un sentido de empoderamiento y propiedad sobre los t\\u00e9rminos comerciales. Este cambio de un enfoque \\u00fanico para todos a una experiencia comercial personalizada es el n\\u00facleo de la misi\\u00f3n de Anaki.<\\/p>"},"ar":{"details":"<p>\\u064a\\u0642\\u062f\\u0645 \\u062a\\u062f\\u0627\\u0648\\u0644 P2P \\u0644\\u0645\\u0633\\u0629 \\u0634\\u062e\\u0635\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0644\\u0644\\u0645\\u0639\\u0627\\u0645\\u0644\\u0627\\u062a \\u0627\\u0644\\u062a\\u064a \\u0644\\u0645 \\u064a\\u0633\\u0645\\u0639 \\u0628\\u0647\\u0627 \\u0645\\u0646 \\u0642\\u0628\\u0644 \\u0641\\u064a \\u0627\\u0644\\u0623\\u0646\\u0638\\u0645\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0645\\u0627\\u0644\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062a\\u0642\\u0644\\u064a\\u062f\\u064a\\u0629. \\u0645\\u0639 Anaki\'s Trade Marketplace\\u060c \\u064a\\u0645\\u0643\\u0646 \\u0644\\u0644\\u0645\\u0633\\u062a\\u062e\\u062f\\u0645\\u064a\\u0646 \\u0627\\u0633\\u062a\\u0643\\u0634\\u0627\\u0641 \\u0645\\u062c\\u0645\\u0648\\u0639\\u0629 \\u0648\\u0627\\u0633\\u0639\\u0629 \\u0645\\u0646 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0641\\u0631\\u0635\\u060c \\u0628\\u062f\\u0621\\u064b\\u0627 \\u0645\\u0646 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0628\\u064a\\u0639 \\u0648\\u0627\\u0644\\u0634\\u0631\\u0627\\u0621 \\u0648\\u062d\\u062a\\u0649 \\u062a\\u0628\\u0627\\u062f\\u0644 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0639\\u0645\\u0644\\u0627\\u062a \\u0648\\u0627\\u0644\\u0633\\u0644\\u0639. \\u064a\\u062a\\u064a\\u062d \\u0646\\u0638\\u0627\\u0645 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0639\\u0631\\u0636 \\u0648\\u0627\\u0644\\u0639\\u0631\\u0636 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0645\\u0642\\u0627\\u0628\\u0644 \\u0625\\u062c\\u0631\\u0627\\u0621 \\u0645\\u0641\\u0627\\u0648\\u0636\\u0627\\u062a \\u0645\\u0635\\u0645\\u0645\\u0629 \\u062e\\u0635\\u064a\\u0635\\u064b\\u0627 \\u0644\\u062a\\u0646\\u0627\\u0633\\u0628 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062a\\u0641\\u0636\\u064a\\u0644\\u0627\\u062a \\u0627\\u0644\\u0641\\u0631\\u062f\\u064a\\u0629\\u060c \\u0645\\u0645\\u0627 \\u064a\\u0639\\u0632\\u0632 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0634\\u0639\\u0648\\u0631 \\u0628\\u0627\\u0644\\u062a\\u0645\\u0643\\u064a\\u0646 \\u0648\\u0627\\u0644\\u0645\\u0644\\u0643\\u064a\\u0629 \\u0641\\u064a\\u0645\\u0627 \\u064a\\u062a\\u0639\\u0644\\u0642 \\u0628\\u0634\\u0631\\u0648\\u0637 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062a\\u062c\\u0627\\u0631\\u0629. \\u064a\\u0639\\u062f \\u0647\\u0630\\u0627 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062a\\u062d\\u0648\\u0644 \\u0645\\u0646 \\u0646\\u0647\\u062c \\u0645\\u0642\\u0627\\u0633 \\u0648\\u0627\\u062d\\u062f \\u064a\\u0646\\u0627\\u0633\\u0628 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062c\\u0645\\u064a\\u0639 \\u0625\\u0644\\u0649 \\u062a\\u062c\\u0631\\u0628\\u0629 \\u062a\\u062f\\u0627\\u0648\\u0644 \\u0645\\u062e\\u0635\\u0635\\u0629 \\u0647\\u0648 \\u062c\\u0648\\u0647\\u0631 \\u0645\\u0647\\u0645\\u0629 Anaki.<\\/p>"}}}','tags' => '{"language":{"en":{"tags":["Echange","Money","Currency","Risk","Pyment","Security"]},"es":{"tags":["Cambio","Dinero","moneda","Riesgo","Pago","Seguridad"]},"ar":{"tags":["Money Out"]}}}','image' => '35808804-0416-4782-8002-b3093f504100.webp','status' => '1','created_at' => '2023-11-25 05:49:22','updated_at' => '2023-11-25 05:49:22'),
            array('id' => '2','admin_id' => '1','title' => '{"language":{"en":{"title":"Effect Of Inflation On Our Daily Expenditure"},"es":{"title":"Efecto de la inflaci\\u00f3n en nuestro gasto diario"},"ar":{"title":"\\u062a\\u0623\\u062b\\u064a\\u0631 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062a\\u0636\\u062e\\u0645 \\u0639\\u0644\\u0649 \\u0625\\u0646\\u0641\\u0627\\u0642\\u0646\\u0627 \\u0627\\u0644\\u064a\\u0648\\u0645\\u064a"}}}','slug' => 'effect-of-inflation-on-our-daily-expenditure','details' => '{"language":{"en":{"details":"<p>The currency exchange system refers to the process of converting one currency into another at an agreed-upon rate. It allows individuals, businesses, and governments to trade and conduct transactions internationally. Here are some key points about the currency exchange system.<\\/p><p>Currency Exchange Methods: Currency exchange can be done through various methods, including banks, currency exchange services, online platforms, and ATMs. Each method may have different fees, exchange rates, and convenience levels, so it\'s advisable to compare options before making a transaction.<\\/p><ul style=\\"list-style-type:none;\\"><li>Exchange Rate.<\\/li><li>Foreign Exchange Market.<\\/li><li>Exchange Rate Determination.<\\/li><li>Currency Exchange Methods.<\\/li><li>Exchange Controls.<\\/li><\\/ul><p>Foreign Exchange Market: Currency exchange transactions take place in the foreign exchange market, which is a decentralized global market. It operates 24 hours a day, except for weekends, and involves a network of banks, financial institutions, corporations, and individual traders.<\\/p>"},"es":{"details":"<p>El sistema de cambio de divisas se refiere al proceso de convertir una moneda en otra a un tipo de cambio acordado. Permite a individuos, empresas y gobiernos comerciar y realizar transacciones a nivel internacional. A continuaci\\u00f3n se detallan algunos puntos clave sobre el sistema de cambio de divisas.<\\/p><p>M\\u00e9todos de cambio de divisas: el cambio de divisas se puede realizar a trav\\u00e9s de varios m\\u00e9todos, incluidos bancos, servicios de cambio de divisas, plataformas en l\\u00ednea y cajeros autom\\u00e1ticos. Cada m\\u00e9todo puede tener diferentes tarifas, tipos de cambio y niveles de conveniencia, por lo que es recomendable comparar opciones antes de realizar una transacci\\u00f3n.<\\/p><p>Tipo de cambio.<br>Mercado de divisas.<br>Determinaci\\u00f3n del Tipo de Cambio.<br>M\\u00e9todos de cambio de divisas.<br>Controles de cambio.<\\/p><p>Mercado de divisas: las transacciones de cambio de divisas se realizan en el mercado de divisas, que es un mercado global descentralizado. Opera las 24 horas del d\\u00eda, excepto los fines de semana, e involucra una red de bancos, instituciones financieras, corporaciones y comerciantes individuales.<\\/p>"},"ar":{"details":"<p>\\u064a\\u0634\\u064a\\u0631 \\u0646\\u0638\\u0627\\u0645 \\u0635\\u0631\\u0641 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0639\\u0645\\u0644\\u0627\\u062a \\u0625\\u0644\\u0649 \\u0639\\u0645\\u0644\\u064a\\u0629 \\u062a\\u062d\\u0648\\u064a\\u0644 \\u0639\\u0645\\u0644\\u0629 \\u0625\\u0644\\u0649 \\u0623\\u062e\\u0631\\u0649 \\u0628\\u0633\\u0639\\u0631 \\u0645\\u062a\\u0641\\u0642 \\u0639\\u0644\\u064a\\u0647. \\u0641\\u0647\\u0648 \\u064a\\u0633\\u0645\\u062d \\u0644\\u0644\\u0623\\u0641\\u0631\\u0627\\u062f \\u0648\\u0627\\u0644\\u0634\\u0631\\u0643\\u0627\\u062a \\u0648\\u0627\\u0644\\u062d\\u0643\\u0648\\u0645\\u0627\\u062a \\u0628\\u0627\\u0644\\u062a\\u062f\\u0627\\u0648\\u0644 \\u0648\\u0625\\u062c\\u0631\\u0627\\u0621 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0645\\u0639\\u0627\\u0645\\u0644\\u0627\\u062a \\u0639\\u0644\\u0649 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0645\\u0633\\u062a\\u0648\\u0649 \\u0627\\u0644\\u062f\\u0648\\u0644\\u064a. \\u0648\\u0641\\u064a\\u0645\\u0627 \\u064a\\u0644\\u064a \\u0628\\u0639\\u0636 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0646\\u0642\\u0627\\u0637 \\u0627\\u0644\\u0631\\u0626\\u064a\\u0633\\u064a\\u0629 \\u062d\\u0648\\u0644 \\u0646\\u0638\\u0627\\u0645 \\u0635\\u0631\\u0641 \\u062